  "keyFeatures": [
    "30 AI agents organized across 7 business units",
    "Paperclip issue tracker for all agent work dispatch",
    "3-tier semantic model routing with automatic fallbacks",
    "wakeOnDemand pattern — agents sleep until assigned work",
    "Review gate ensuring verified completion before issue close",
    "Dual-gateway throughput isolation (AGE vs. business agents)",
    "Unified health daemon monitoring 17 subsystems with auto-heal",
    "Escalation tiers (Tier 1/2/3) for approval governance"
